   "source": [
    "# From crash records to a Tableau dashboard\n",
    "\n",
    "**Question:** When and where do severe outcomes concentrate among recorded injury/fatal crashes in Los Angeles County?\n",
    "\n",
    "Follow four steps: **clean \u2192 explore \u2192 model \u2192 communicate**",
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "9b68229e",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-16T04:58:54.282188Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-16T04:58:54.282007Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-16T04:58:55.250394Z",
