   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Handle missingness where it matters\n",
    "\n",
    "HHMM must have a valid hour **and** minute. A value such as 2500 is unknown, not a time. Preserve these records for overall and geographic totals, but leave them out of time-of-day comparisons. Missing coordinates affect the map export only; there is no blanket drop-missing-values operation."
   ]
  },
