   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Interpretation:** ROC AUC is about **0.627**; severe precision is **17%** and recall is **32%**. The model offers modest discrimination. An always-majority prediction would be about **89% accurate** yet detect no severe cases, which is why accuracy alone is insufficient. That reference is an arithmetic comparison, not another fitted model.\n",
    "\n",
    "The model predicts severity conditional on an observed crash, not whether a future crash will occur."
   ]
  },
